  "join": { en: "The join utility performs an 'equality join' on the specified files and writes the result to the standard output. The 'join field' is the field in each file by which the files are compared. The first field in each line is used by default. There is one line in the output for each pair of lines in file1 and file2 which have identical join fields. Each output line consists of the join field, the remaining fields from file1 and then the remaining fields from file2", zhCN: "join 工具对指定文件执行“等值连接”，并将结果写入标准输出。“连接字段”是各文件中用于比较的字段，默认使用每行的第一个字段。file1 与 file2 中连接字段相同的每一对行都会输出一行；每行由连接字段、file1 的其余字段和 file2 的其余字段组成", zhTW: "join 工具對指定檔案執行“等值連線”，並將結果寫入標準輸出。“連線欄位”是各檔案中用於比較的欄位，預設使用每行的第一個欄位。file1 與 file2 中連線欄位相同的每一對行都會輸出一行；每行由連線欄位、file1 的其餘欄位和 file2 的其餘欄位組成" },
